    {
      "tag": "H1",
      "text": "About Magal",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "100px",
      "weight": "800",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "55 Years",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "280px",
      "weight": "800",
      "color": "rgba(0, 37, 205, 0.6)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "text": "About Magal",
      "font": "Jura",
      "size": "30px",
      "weight": "700",
      "color": "rgb(0, 37, 205)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "For over 55 years, Magal Solutions has been a leading global integrator of large-scale, turnkey projects, providing security, safety and operational efficiency solutions to nations’ most critical and strategic assets, worldwide.\nProviding complete project life-cycle services, Magal’s offering includ",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "18px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H4",
      "text": "Markets",
      "font": "Jura",
      "size": "30px",
      "weight": "700",
      "color": "rgb(0, 37, 205)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "Magal’s End-to-End solutions are specifically tailored to the unique requirements of the\nHomeland Security (HLS) industry sectors:",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "18px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "– National Borders\n– Seaports\n– Oil & Gas\n– Critical Infrastructure (Airports, Govt. Buildings, Critical Infrastructure, Correctional Facilities, Stadiums and Arenas).",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "18px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H4",
      "text": "Our Vision",
      "font": "Jura",
      "size": "30px",
      "weight": "700",
      "color": "rgb(0, 37, 205)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "To create a safer, secure, and sustainable environment, to efficiently operate the world’s\nmost critical assets.",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "18px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H4",
      "text": "Our Mission",
      "font": "Jura",
      "size": "30px",
      "weight": "700",
      "color": "rgb(0, 37, 205)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "Fusing operational data to create unified eco-systems, empowering our customers to be proactive with actionable insights to achieve what matters most – security, safety, and efficiency.",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "18px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "text": "Our Values",
      "font": "Jura",
      "size": "30px",
      "weight": "700",
      "color": "rgb(0, 37, 205)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H4",
      "text": "Creativity & Innovation",
      "font": "Jura",
      "size": "22px",
      "weight": "700",
      "color": "rgb(0, 37, 205)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "True innovation means creative thinking, constant development, and innovative solutions to best accommodate our customer’s needs.",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "18px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H4",
      "text": "A Trusted Partner",
      "font": "Jura",
      "size": "22px",
      "weight": "700",
      "color": "rgb(0, 37, 205)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "We believe that creating the best end-to-end solutions is based on long-term partnerships, understanding our customer’s specific needs to foresee new ones, and being there for them every step of the way",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "18px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H4",
      "text": "Excellence",
      "font": "Jura",
      "size": "22px",
      "weight": "700",
      "color": "rgb(0, 37, 205)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "We bring 55 years of excellence in creating end-to-end solutions, transforming uncertainty into a well-managed project.",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "18px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H4",
      "text": "Agility & Adaptability",
      "font": "Jura",
      "size": "22px",
      "weight": "700",
      "color": "rgb(0, 37, 205)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "We are results-driven with an unrelenting determination for the success of our clients.\nEquipped with the ability to adapt, we maintain effectiveness in a continuously\nchanging environment. No matter the circumstances – we always find a way.",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "18px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H4",
      "text": "Customer Centricity",
      "font": "Jura",
      "size": "22px",
      "weight": "700",
      "color": "rgb(0, 37, 205)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "Being customer focused is deeply rooted in our mindset and DNA. We continuously seek to provide added value through tailored solutions, ongoing support, knowledge transfer and accessible data.",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "18px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H4",
      "text": "Ranked #1 in Homeland Security (HLS)",
      "font": "Jura",
      "size": "26px",
      "weight": "700",
      "color": "rgb(0, 37, 205)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "Magal was ranked #1 in the Homeland Security (HLS) category in the 2026 Dun’s 100 Defense Industry ranking.",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
